{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_dminon_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_dminon_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"无名尸","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"逃往边境的路上，重伤的雷尔金意识到同伴对自己的崇拜已经成了他们最大的拖累。他最终的意愿，是杀死那个身为英雄的“雷尔金”。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_dminon_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["雷尔金","忧虑的矿工","雷尔金？","打捞工","捕鳞人","叛逃者","关切的矿工","沉默的尸体","恐惧的矿工们","？？？","遥远的回响"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"animtext","id":9,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯荒野</><p=2>1101年末</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":10},{"type":"animtextclean","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowfootstep","volume":"1","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.4","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-80","duration":"1","id":17},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":18},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"0.7","id":19},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_kneelsnow_s","delay":"0.2","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"*乌萨斯粗口*！","id":22},{"type":"charslot","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"停下吧，求你了。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"charslot","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","posfrom":"0,-80","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":28},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"我自己能走……","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"为了把你那条断腿绑起来，大家是从衣服上扯布料做的绷带。它要是再断了，我们就真没办法了。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"来吧，我扶着你走。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#3$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"……","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowfootstep","volume":"1","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"6","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"就是这儿了。我们找了棵看起来最体面的树埋他。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#3$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"格列布……格列布。我把他从岗哨里背出来的，那时候他还在嘟哝着抱怨自己断了手，以后吹不出整个村子都能听见的口哨了。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"结果我再睁眼的时候，他就已经死了、埋了。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"你昏过去之后不久，他就死了。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"这块石头就是他的碑？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"怎么……埋得这么深？哪怕下大雪，也不该这么快就积这么厚……","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#6$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"不……不对。他是什么时候死的？什么时候埋的？我昏迷了多久？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"他是三天前死的，两天前埋的。你昏过去有三天多了，雷尔金。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#6$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"这三天多，你们一直留在这儿，没往前走？","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"埋了格列布之后，我们试过。但……","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"但什么？","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我们没找到能带你走的办法。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"侥幸从那座岗哨逃出来的，本来就没几个人了。那些第一波跟着你冲锋的有力气的年轻人，几乎全被炸死了。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我们剩下的人没那个力气一直抬着你走，但把你放在木板上拖着，你的伤口又立刻就会渗血。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"只好先停下来，至少让你缓缓。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"听着，我们是逃出来了，不是被放过了。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"集团军现在还在清剿矿区，我们多停一天，就多一分被找到的风险。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"这不是什么难算的账，你们早该往前走了。总不能就因为我……","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"别说傻话了，雷尔金。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"bgeffect","id":84},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_66_g4_miningarea_polluted.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":88},{"type":"animtext","id":89,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>“帷幕”彼端</><p=2>00:00:00</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":90},{"type":"animtextclean","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"……","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"打捞工","text":"你不吃吗？唉。对不起啊，我们也拿不出更好的东西了。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"你们的吃的本来就不多，不用特地拿来招待我。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"打捞工","text":"马卡，来把你的臭熏鳞拿走吧，确实是太臭了。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"你闭嘴吧。端条熏鳞还委屈到你了是吗？是我想把它做得这样臭气熏天的？你不清楚为什么我们只有这烂玩意吃？","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"打捞工","text":"我，唉，我们……","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"那群暴徒害我们的村子沉进了湖底，就这么简单。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"我们祖祖辈辈都在涅瓦湖上过活，冬天湖面冻上，我们就凿孔下网，不管时节好坏，起码能捕到够我们自己吃的鳞。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"但他们不在乎。他们就那么堂而皇之地杀了我们的年轻人，又把炮火带到我们的村子里。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"我们没了房子，没了存粮，没了捕鳞的船和工具，就连我做熏鳞的炉子和调料也都没了。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"我知道他们能做出什么事来。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"有什么我能帮你们的？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"打捞工","text":"我们一直在等。都说乌萨斯真正的军人会铲除暴徒、伸张正义。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"打捞工","text":"他们赶走了入侵的梦魇，推翻了骏鹰的暴政，是真正的英雄。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"打捞工","text":"对了，伊戈尔大帝的传记，你读过吗？","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"说什么呢，他就是我们等的人，他怎么可能不知道这些。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"真正的军人，乌萨斯的英雄……呼。我会尽量不辜负你们的赞誉。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"我们逃出来的时候，从湖里捞上来一个他们的人。求你杀了他，杀了他，然后再去杀了他的同伙。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-80","duration":"1","id":134},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":135},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"0.7","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_kneelsnow_s","delay":"0.2","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"*乌萨斯粗口*——","id":139},{"type":"charslot","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"闭嘴。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"你们要我杀了他？可他为什么穿着矿工的衣服？","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"他当然穿着矿工的衣服。他就是那个暴徒雷尔金的同伙。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"暴徒……雷尔金？！","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"text","text":"他看了看眼前被摁倒在地的矿工，又低头看了看自己。","id":150},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"2","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":153},{"type":"text","text":"他看见一套再熟悉不过的制服。他曾经死死地盯着这样的一身制服，试图辨别那漆黑的布料下面哪里藏着一颗跳动的心脏。","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"他分明记得自己把矿镐捅进了那颗心脏，那身制服在自己身下垮塌下去。","id":155},{"type":"text","text":"可它现在，分明又出现在了自己身上。","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"为什么……我？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"打捞工","text":"内卫大人，求你惩治那个暴徒。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"雷尔金把炮火带到了我们村子。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":164},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magicchange","volume":"1","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1971_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"2","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"雷尔金让我亲手杀死我的儿子。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_1971_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magicchange","volume":"1","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"2","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"雷尔金带着我们所有人去送死。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_3.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":181},{"type":"animtext","id":182,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯荒野</><p=2>1101年末</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":183},{"type":"animtextclean","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"现在，把所有人都叫醒，营火熄掉，帐篷撤掉。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"一秒都不要等，我们立刻出发。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"你来给格列布上坟这一路上就摔了多少次？怎么走？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我们以往在矿里摔断了腿的，不起码还要歇个五六天吗？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"你还不明白吗，再拖下去集团军一定会找上我们，到时候我们都会死。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我明白。现在在这儿的人，谁不是从他们的炮火底下逃出来的？但我们不可能不管你。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"雷尔金，英雄的雷尔金，把远北的矿区都连起来的雷尔金……我们的希望是你给的，我们的命也是你给的。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我们不能没有你。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"“我们将永远都是伙伴，永远都是战友”，你说过的话，我都还记得呢，“相互扶持，分担一样的痛苦”。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"是，我们没法分担你断了腿的痛苦。但至少，你这身伤病带来的风险，我们可以一起承担。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"我也说过，如果我倒下了，你们都不要停留。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"可你还没倒下呢，不是吗？我们还没找到你说的那个整合运动的农庄，我们都不信你会就这样倒下。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#3$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"……","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#3$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"搭把手，扶我起来。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"charslot","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#3$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"……嘶。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"怎么了？","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"别问，继续走。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"强忍着腿上的剧痛，雷尔金一步一步地踏过雪地。他在心底沉默地计着数，一秒，一秒，又一秒。","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"（一，二，三，四，五……）","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"（一百二十一，一百二十二，一百二十三……）","id":228},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金数得很清楚。五分钟过去，十分钟过去，半小时过去了。这片小小的树林，他好像怎么走都走不出去。","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"不行。不可能。带着我，照这个速度……哪怕不被集团军追上，我们身上的干粮，都不够我们走到边境的。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"你们必须先走。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"换成是之前，可能有人会这么干吧。你知道，经过这一遭，大家现在都不一样了。过去我们像循兽一样被赶来赶去，但现在……","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"别再提我说过的话了！你们不该像着了魔似的追随一个连路都走不了的残废，谁都不该。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"如果你们真的还在乎我说的话，那就走，立刻走。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"我会跟上的。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_bg_66_g7_farnorthtundra.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"……我会跟上的。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"charslot","id":254},{"type":"text","text":"他知道自己不会了。","id":255},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金已经不觉得疼了，他几乎感受不到双腿的存在。他试着像使用工具一样挪动它们，但它们只是扭曲着、颤抖着，抗拒着他的意愿。","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"五十七个……这就是全部了。逃出来的人，都在前面了。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"接着往前走吧，往前走。别回头。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"charslot","id":262},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金的脚步慢了下来。远处，雪地上的黑点越来越小。他努力睁大干涩的眼，想要看着他们消失在地平线上。","id":263},{"type":"text","text":"事与愿违。","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#6$1","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"不，不……别回头，别回来！","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#6$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"走啊，接着走啊！我说了我能跟上！","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"关切的矿工","text":"你带我们走出了矿区，我们不可能抛下你。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"*乌萨斯粗口*，如果我死在这，你们能往前走吗？","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"关切的矿工","text":"雷尔金，把镐子放下，好吗？","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"我不知道该怎么把我跟你们说过的话收回去，我也不知道再说什么才能让你们听进去。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"但如果你们是因为我才没法往前走，那就让我用最简单的办法解决问题。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1969_1#1$1","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"关切的矿工","text":"雷尔金，别！","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1969_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":281},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金即将把矿镐凿进自己脑袋的前一刻，矿工扑了上来。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金并不是从小就知道抗争和起义是什么意思，但他从小就知道凭自己的力气能解决很多问题。","id":284},{"type":"text","text":"他是凭自己的力气把父亲从坍塌的矿井里拽了出来，把斧子从守林人游击兵手里夺了下来，把矿镐捅进了一个内卫的胸膛。","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"所以，当矿工试图夺下矿镐的时候，他下意识地觉得只要用上全部的力气，就没人能拦住他把矿镐凿进自己的脑袋。","id":286},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_attack_heavy","volume":"0.9","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bone_rub","volume":"0.9","id":289},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"8","ystrength":"6","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":291},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":292},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"0.7","id":293},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_kneelsnow_s","delay":"0.2","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#7$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"不，不！为什么？！我*乌萨斯粗口*是朝着我自己的脑袋砸的！","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#7$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"说话，说话啊，你在干什么？！","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的尸体","text":"……","id":301},{"type":"dialog","id":302},{"type":"charslot","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金抬起头。远处，雪地上的黑点越来越大。所有矿工都回了头，他们不明白为什么有血在雪地上蔓延。","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#6$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"不，不对，我不是——","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"charslot","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"他想道歉，想解释，但他忽然停住了。他忽然意识到，这是他仅有的机会。","id":309},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":311},{"type":"charslot","id":312},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_66_g4_miningarea_polluted.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":316},{"type":"animtext","id":317,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>“帷幕”彼端</><p=2>00:00:00</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":318},{"type":"animtextclean","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"……霍里？尼克托？我以为你们都已经死了。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"我们为什么会死？","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"这些捕鳞人和打捞工又为什么会无家可归？","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"是因为那些纠察队的畜生不给人半点活路。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"驻守涅瓦湖岗哨的士兵里，有很多都是那个村子里的年轻人。他们也都是畜生吗？","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"他们拿着乌萨斯的武器，却用来像看守牲口一样看守乌萨斯人？那他们也该死。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"他们是拿着乌萨斯的武器。每年冬天，他们都用前锋部队配备的武器帮村里凿开冰面，为了捕鳞。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"然后，他们会带着村里的腌鳞回到岗哨，分给那些来自远北各地的战友。“圣骏堡的肉排，涅瓦湖的鳞”，他们都这么开玩笑。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"你怎么知道？","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"他们在逃亡路上把我从湖里救了起来。起初，他们只当我是个落水的可怜人，所以什么都跟我讲了。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"但他们后来又为什么要殴打我、关押我，然后把我送上处刑台，求你砍了我的头？","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"就因为我说了我认识雷尔金。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"一个名字，就可以让人做他们原本不会做的事，送死也好，杀人也罢。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_bg_66_g7_farnorthtundra.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"一个名字，就可以让人做他们原本不会做的事，送死也好，杀人也罢……","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"那是不是就算我死了，也没有用？他们还会试图安葬我。在这硬邦邦的冻土上挖一座坟，又要耽误多久？","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#3$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"就因为我被叫做“高尚的雷尔金”“反抗者雷尔金”“矿工领袖雷尔金”……“英雄的雷尔金”。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#3$1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"我该怎么杀死一个名字？","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_66_g4_miningarea_polluted.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"这件蓑衣你拿着吧。涅瓦湖上现在还在飘源石碎屑，别脏了你的制服。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"打捞工","text":"这是我从布列斯克带回来的干花，本来是给我老婆的，但她人已经不在了。求你带着这束花，去杀了那个罪魁祸首。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_094","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"打捞工","text":"那个雷尔金。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_094.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_081","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"捕鳞人","text":"求你杀了他。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_081.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":375},{"type":"charslot","id":376},{"type":"text","text":"在身穿内卫制服的人身后，无家可归者聚集起来。他们每个人都想为他献上点什么。","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"他们的生活几十年如一日，他们搞不清事情的原委。他们只知道有一天，一个叫雷尔金的矿工带人杀光了他们那些在岗哨服役的儿女。","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"这些人引来的炮火炸塌了冰面，叫他们的村子沉入了湖底。","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"他们只能乞求他们认知中最纯粹的乌萨斯军人为他们伸张正义。","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"……","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1967_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"你不高兴吗，雷尔金？","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1967_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":386},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magicchange","volume":"1","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1964_1#1$1","duration":"2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","isblock":"true","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"你所有的忍耐，难道不都是为了这一刻？","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1964_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"为了作为一位真正的乌萨斯军人，分担你所爱之人的苦痛。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1964_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"你将用自己双手上的血，换来乌萨斯的洁净，一如伊戈尔曾经所为。然后，众人都将爱你。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1964_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"叛逃者","text":"你应当欣喜。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_1964_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"不……","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金？","text":"不。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":398},{"type":"charslot","id":399},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_bg_66_g7_farnorthtundra.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"如果英雄就*乌萨斯粗口*是这种东西……","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#10$1","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"那雷尔金就永远不该成为英雄。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":408},{"type":"charslot","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金用尽自己仅剩的力气，挥起矿镐砸向身下的那具沉默的尸体。","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"一下，两下，三下。直到血溅满他的脸，直到那副朴实的面容变成难以辨认的血肉。","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"那是个无辜的人，是个关心他的人。他多想扑下去为自己愚蠢的失手而痛哭、道歉，但他只能逼着自己拼命地挥动镐子。","id":412},{"type":"text","text":"纠察队骂他疯了的时候，他为之骄傲；尼克托骂他疯了的时候，他不屑一顾。但现在，他无比希望自己看起来足够像一个疯人。","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"只有这样，他才能杀死“英雄的雷尔金”这个名字。","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"对，对，就是这样！没看到吗，没看清吗，我是个疯人，不是什么英雄！","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"走啊，都走！不然我把你们也杀了！","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"都*乌萨斯粗口*给我滚！","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"charslot","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐惧的矿工们","text":"……","id":423},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#5$1","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"走啊！走……","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"charslot","id":427},{"type":"text","text":"雪灌进了他的嗓子。他再也吼不动了。","id":428},{"type":"text","text":"但眼前的人群，也开始一步一步地后退。后退，转身，离开。","id":429},{"type":"text","text":"直到雪地里又只剩下雷尔金一人。","id":430},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"接着往前走吧，往前走。别回头。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"至少你们能活下来。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":435},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":436},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":437},{"type":"charslot","id":438},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_bg_66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":439},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":442},{"type":"animtext","id":443,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>“帷幕”与现实的交会处</><p=2>00:00:01</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":444},{"type":"animtextclean","id":445},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":446},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_n_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_mist_n_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":447,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"2","id":448},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……雷尔金。","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"他们走出去多远了？","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"我一直在数。已经过去两天了，应该很远了。","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"你追不上他们的。我不会让你追上。我杀过一个内卫，就还能再杀第二个。","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你会死。","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"无所谓。我伤到你一点，他们的活路就多一分。","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6d/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":460},{"type":"charslot","id":461},{"type":"text","text":"没再多说什么，雷尔金拖着残躯爬向了穿着内卫制服的人。","id":462},{"type":"text","text":"他已经不感到冷了。灼烧感仿佛滚烫的炉火在身上蔓延，那些使他血液沸腾的，也使他双眼清明。","id":463},{"type":"text","text":"他扑了上去，对准那副黑色的面孔——捅下去。","id":464},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"挣扎……","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"够了。","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4246_dminon_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":469},{"type":"charslot","id":470},{"type":"text","text":"雷尔金重重地摔在地上。这一次，除了稍稍划破了面具，他没能伤到那黑色身躯半分。","id":471},{"type":"text","text":"但就在那副面具的缺口之下，他看见了自己的脸。","id":472},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#7$1","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷尔金","text":"——？！","id":474,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/ba/Avg_avg_npc_1963_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":475},{"type":"dialog","id":476},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":477},{"type":"charslot","id":478},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1963_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":479},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":480},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":481},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":482},{"type":"sticker","id":483,"text":"霍里，尼克托，别乔克。利特，保尔，格列布……该死，我身下这一小片雪地写不下每个人的名字。","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"220","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":484,"text":"\\n\\n我希望你们都还活着，都学会了怎么杀掉那些该死的人。","x":"300","y":"300","alignment":"left","multi":"true","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":485,"text":"\\n\\n我希望你们这样做的时候，不是呐喊着我的名字。","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"left","multi":"true","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":486,"text":"\\n\\n那个名字困住了太多人，我自己也不例外。","x":"300","y":"380","alignment":"left","size":"24","multi":"true","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":487,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":488,"text":"我明知道，如果还有第二个内卫追来，逃出去的人一定凶多吉少。","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"220","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":489,"text":"\\n\\n但我还是想象自己又遇到一个内卫，想象自己又冲上去要杀死他，好像要复现当初的那个奇迹。","x":"300","y":"300","alignment":"left","multi":"true","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":490,"text":"\\n\\n我可能还是不想就这么平淡地死掉吧。","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"left","multi":"true","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":491,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":492,"text":"就连现在，我也还在雪地里写着这些字，这些我明知道留不下来的字。","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"220","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":493,"text":"\\n\\n大概谁到了最后，都会想留下点什么吧。但我留下的已经太多，多到成了你们所有人的枷锁。","x":"300","y":"300","alignment":"left","multi":"true","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":494,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":495,"text":"别乔克，记得给那块秒表上发条。如果它不转了，就……","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"220","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":496,"text":"\\n\\n算了。你自己会学会的。","x":"300","y":"300","alignment":"left","multi":"true","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":497,"text":"\\n\\n……","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"left","multi":"true","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":498,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":499,"text":"下雪吧，下雪。把雷尔金和他写的字都埋掉。埋在这里。","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"220","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":500,"duration":"1"},{"type":"dialog","id":501},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":502},{"type":"charslot","id":503},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_bg_66_g7_farnorthtundra.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":504},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":505},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":506},{"type":"delay","time":"2","text":"","id":507},{"type":"animtext","id":508,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯荒野</><p=2>1102年初</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":509},{"type":"animtextclean","id":510},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":511},{"type":"dialogue","name":"遥远的回响","text":"我赐给你们生机。","id":512},{"type":"dialogue","name":"遥远的回响","text":"也赐给你们死亡。","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"遥远的回响","text":"接受它。","id":514},{"type":"dialog","id":515},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4246_dminon_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":516},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":517},{"type":"text","text":"一具穿着内卫制服的躯壳，从雪原上苏醒。他眼前是一具埋在雪里的尸体，某个他不认识的人。","id":518},{"type":"text","text":"圣愚以为那个人终其一生都会渴望成为英雄而不得。它在他身上埋下种子，祈望永不满足的渴望能发酵出最可怖的意志。","id":519},{"type":"text","text":"它不会理解，执念深重的人怎么会在生命的最后一刻抛弃所有的渴望。所以它也不会料到，自己就只创造出了一具空荡荡的躯壳。","id":520},{"type":"text","text":"当然，躯壳不知道这些，他迷茫地检视着眼前的尸体。尸体已经冻得严严实实，他只能从上面扯下一个破烂的兜帽。","id":521},{"type":"text","text":"而后，他跨过尸体，向前走去。","id":522},{"type":"dialog","id":523},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":524},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":525},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":526},{"type":"charslot","id":527},{"type":"image","id":528}],"characters":["雷尔金","忧虑的矿工","雷尔金？","打捞工","捕鳞人","叛逃者","关切的矿工","沉默的尸体","恐惧的矿工们","？？？","遥远的回响"]}